Thursday 2026-10-08 dipped to 2,280 rides on a rainy day with 31 mm of rain. Saturday 2026-10-17 was the busiest day, with 5,340 rides.

table daily title="Daily rides" heat

## Weekdays and weekends

Weekend days averaged 5,162.5 rides, about 1,790 more than a typical weekday. Rebalancing crews matter most on Saturdays and Sundays.

